  (text "Boost switch (as PCB-036)"
    (at 21.27 26.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "1022c70e-7d9a-578e-bdde-b5c3be64a3d5"))
  (text "IO2 drives the logic-level FET directly, 32 kHz,\nduty clamped to ~41 % by firmware (HV_DUTY_MAX).\n10k gate-source keeps the FET off (and IO2 low) during boot."
    (at 25 105 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "ffd15232-894f-597a-9b9c-a235ea0a6f06"))
  (rectangle
    (start 160 25)
    (end 400 120)
    (stroke
      (width 0.15)
      (type dash))
    (fill
      (type none))
    (uuid "1213c13f-78f9-5358-8cd6-bf25310db023"))
  (text "Cockcroft-Walton multiplier, 7 x 10MQ100N, 7 x 2u2/100V (PCB-036 used 1u)"
    (at 161.27 26.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "faa88f47-3225-5c00-8adf-5f70ca647aea"))
  (text "Each stage adds one boost peak (~45 V at 170 V out); no part sees more than ~100 V."
    (at 165 110 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "5646f634-18fc-5cdb-a9be-6765bd1a3c4a"))
  (rectangle
    (start 20 130)
    (end 400 200)
    (stroke
      (width 0.15)
      (type dash))
    (fill
      (type none))
    (uuid "e93de478-16d2-5c9e-8ed6-d1b59970d6b7"))
  (text "Output, feedback (KOMP_170V) and ADC clamp"
    (at 21.27 131.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "64801cc2-ca3a-511f-bde5-ea612bc58d81"))
  (text "Divider ratio (430k+6k2)/6k2 = 70.35 = HV_DIV_RATIO in display_testa.cpp.\n170 V -> 2.42 V at IO35. BAT54S clamps to 3V3 (the original clamped to 5 V).\nUse 1 % parts; 430k in 1206 for working voltage."
    (at 170 160 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "8b84127c-4227-575d-a145-480c310198ca"))
